#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Parameters to set when provisioning a Qiskit Runtime service instance, and "
"extension fields returned when accessing an instance."
msgstr ""
"Parameter yang perlu ditetapkan semasa memperuntukkan contoh perkhidmatan "
"Qiskit Runtime, dan medan sambungan yang dikembalikan apabila mengakses "
"contoh."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Platform APIs to access instances"
msgstr "Gunakan IBM Cloud Platform APIs untuk mengakses contoh"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore ResourceController  */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use IBM Cloud Platform APIs to access instances {#use-ibm-cloud-platform-"
"apis-to-access-instances}"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan IBM Cloud Platform APIs untuk mengakses contoh {#use-ibm-cloud-"
"platform-apis-to-access-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide is for anyone using the IBM Cloud Platform APIs to provision, "
"update, or manage access to instances. It provides details on the "
"[parameters](#parameters) you can set when provisioning an instance, as well"
" as the set of [extension fields](#extensions) returned when you access an "
"instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini ditujukan untuk sesiapa yang menggunakan IBM Cloud Platform APIs"
" untuk memperuntuk, mengemas kini, atau mengurus akses ke contoh. Ia "
"menyediakan butiran tentang [parameter](#parameters) yang boleh anda "
"tetapkan semasa memperuntuk contoh, serta set [medan sambungan](#extensions)"
" yang dikembalikan apabila anda mengakses contoh.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Refer to the IBM Cloud&reg; ResourceController API documentation for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Rujuk dokumentasi API ResourceController IBM Cloud&reg; untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some relevant pages:\n"
"- [Create (provision) a new resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Update a resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Get a resource instance](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Get a list of all resource instances](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances)  \n"
msgstr ""
"Beberapa halaman yang berkaitan:\n"
"- [Cipta (peruntuk) contoh sumber baru](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#create-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Kemas kini contoh sumber](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#update-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Dapatkan contoh sumber](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#get-resource-instance)\n"
"- [Dapatkan senarai semua contoh sumber](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/resource-controller/resource-controller#list-resource-instances)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When getting a list of all resource instances, note that you can filter to "
"only Qiskit Runtime instances with `resource_id = "
"\"b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f\"`\n"
msgstr ""
"    Apabila mendapatkan senarai semua contoh sumber, perhatikan bahawa anda "
"boleh menapis untuk contoh Qiskit Runtime sahaja dengan `resource_id = "
"\"b6049020-80f4-11eb-a0f7-e35ec9b4054f\"`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</Admonition>\n"
msgstr "</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`parameters` {#parameters}"
msgstr "`parameters` {#parameters}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In the body when provisioning or updating an instance:\n"
msgstr "Dalam badan semasa memperuntuk atau mengemas kini contoh:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- **instance_limit_seconds** (string or null, `^[0-9]+$`): The limit to set on the instance. For Open Plan: if omitted, this defaults to 10 minutes.\n"
".\n"
"- **usage_allocation_seconds** (string or null, `^[0-9]+$`): Allotted time for the instance, used by the fair-share scheduler to determine the priority in the queue, based on usage of all QPUs. (This does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.)\n"
"- **backends** (array of lists of backends (strings or null) or array with \"ANY\"): the allow-list of names of backends that are available to this instance. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, means all backends available on this plan. `[]` means no backends.\n"
msgstr ""
"- **instance_limit_seconds** (rentetan atau null, `^[0-9]+$`): Had yang ditetapkan pada contoh. Untuk Plan Terbuka: jika diabaikan, lalai ini kepada 10 minit.\n"
".\n"
"- **usage_allocation_seconds** (rentetan atau null, `^[0-9]+$`): Masa yang diperuntukkan untuk contoh, digunakan oleh penjadual bahagian adil untuk menentukan keutamaan dalam giliran, berdasarkan penggunaan semua QPU. (Ini tidak terpakai untuk contoh Pay-As-You-Go.)\n"
"- **backends** (tatasusunan senarai Backend (rentetan atau null) atau tatasusunan dengan \"ANY\"): senarai putih nama Backend yang tersedia untuk contoh ini. Lalai: `[\"ANY\"]`, bermakna semua Backend tersedia pada plan ini. `[]` bermakna tiada Backend.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`extensions` {#extensions}"
msgstr "`extensions` {#extensions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the response when provisioning or when getting the details of an "
"instance:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam respons semasa memperuntuk atau apabila mendapatkan butiran contoh:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional instance properties contributed by the service that are "
"represented as key-value pairs. These properties persist with the instance "
"under the extensions property.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sifat contoh tambahan yang disumbangkan oleh perkhidmatan yang diwakili "
"sebagai pasangan kunci-nilai. Sifat-sifat ini kekal dengan contoh di bawah "
"sifat sambungan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**instance_limit_seconds** (integer or null, `>= 0`): The time limit to set "
"on the instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"**instance_limit_seconds** (integer atau null, `>= 0`): Had masa yang "
"ditetapkan pada contoh.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**usage_allocation_seconds** (integer or null, `>= 0`): Allotted time for "
"the instance, used by the fair-share scheduler to determine the priority in "
"the queue, based on usage of all QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"**usage_allocation_seconds** (integer atau null, `>= 0`): Masa yang "
"diperuntukkan untuk contoh, digunakan oleh penjadual bahagian adil untuk "
"menentukan keutamaan dalam giliran, berdasarkan penggunaan semua QPU.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**backends** (Required; array of lists of backends (strings) or array with "
"\"ANY\" (strings)): The allow-list of names of backends that are available "
"to this instance. Default: `[\"ANY\"]`, means all backends are available on "
"this plan. `[]` means no backends.\n"
msgstr ""
"**backends** (Diperlukan; tatasusunan senarai Backend (rentetan) atau "
"tatasusunan dengan \"ANY\" (rentetan)): Senarai putih nama Backend yang "
"tersedia untuk contoh ini. Lalai: `[\"ANY\"]`, bermakna semua Backend "
"tersedia pada plan ini. `[]` bermakna tiada Backend.\n"
